hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1421","We are Muhammad bin Yahya, we are Muhammad bin Abdullah Al-Ansari, my father told me, on the authority of Thumama, on the authority of Anas bin Malik, he said: Omar bin Al-Khattab, when they became parched, went out to draw water with Al-Abbas, saying: “O God, when we were parched, we used to draw water from your Prophet, so you provided us with water. Today we ask you for water through the uncle of your Prophet, or our Prophet, so give us water, and they will be given water.” Al-Ansari said: This is what I found in my book in my own writing, so they will be given water."
